<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Patch>
  <!--
    Combat Extended parity for the three pieces, both tiers. CE reads ArmorRating_Sharp as
    millimetres of RHA and ArmorRating_Blunt as megapascals, counts a worn item's full Mass
    against a 40 kg CarryWeight, scales its smoke's inhalation hediff by SmokeSensitivity and
    Breathing alone, and rescales nothing it has not patched by defName (its apparel autopatcher
    is off by default and matches no multi-layer warcasket preset). CE's own VFE Pirates patch
    (ModPatches/Vanilla Factions Expanded - Pirates/.../Apparel_Warcaskets.xml and
    Apparel_Warcaskets_Spacer.xml) reaches only VFEP's defNames; from its base-class patches
    ours inherit Flammability 0.25 and the helmet and shoulder PartialArmorExt alone. So
    unpatched the set wore flak-jacket plating, moved at the speed floor under 108 kg and
    breathed CE's smoke through a sealed helmet.

    Each tier copies a VFEP chassis exactly, so the CE numbers are that chassis's. Heat is
    never touched, as in every CE patch; uranium, chemfuel and the 7th-gen plasteel are not in
    CE's cost rescale and stay. Nothing else CE does reaches the set: vanilla tox gas, the
    set's gas explosions (GenExplosion with ToxGas and no damage amount), the gas jet verb and
    the reloadables all run as without CE, and CE's own tox grenades and rounds emit vanilla
    ToxGas, which Absorb Gas takes as it takes a tox pack's. CE's black smoke is a Thing, not
    gas, so Absorb Gas cannot take it.
    - 7th generation (spacerTier off): the Aerial's, whose vanilla plating the set shares to the
      decimal. Plating 28 / 70 on armor and shoulders, 25 / 56 on the helmet. Bulk / WornBulk
      250 / 25, 15 / 5, 15 / 8. Costs on CE's industrial rescale, steel and components x2.
      NightVisionEfficiency_Apparel 0.5, CE's for every industrial warcasket helmet.
    - Spacer tier (spacerTier on): the Siegebreaker's, the Controller's and the Sarcophagus's,
      the sets whose blunt 1 pattern the tier copies. Plating 36 / 90 and 32 / 72. Bulk 275 / 35,
      15 / 5, 20 / 10. Shield 2.25 / 0.015, CE's x1.5 on the tier's 1.5 / 0.01 (VEF's
      CompShieldBubble absorbs CE projectiles unpatched; only the numbers move). Costs on CE's
      spacer rescale, plasteel x1.5 and two more spacer components on the armor and helmet.
      NightVisionEfficiency_Apparel 0.75, the spacer helmets'.
    - Both tiers: CarryWeight +250 on the armor, CarryBulk +200 (industrial) or +225 (spacer)
      and Suppressability -100, the frames' carry offsets and immunity to suppression, without
      which the set moves at half speed. SmokeSensitivity -1 on the helmet (the stat clamps at
      0) makes the wearer immune to CE's smoke, CE's convention for every sealed helmet; the
      Breathing floor of the respirator does not count there. immuneToToxGasExposure is on the
      helmet def already.

    Ordering: this file and SpacerTier.xml both live in this folder, and patch files within a
    mod apply in filesystem order, so neither may depend on running after the other. Under CE
    this file owns plating, shield stats and costs for both tiers, and SpacerTier.xml skips its
    own versions of exactly those (its "without Combat Extended" block); everything this file
    adds or replaces is then a node SpacerTier.xml never touches under CE, and every xpath here
    resolves against the unpatched def. That is why the spacer branch replaces each costList
    whole rather than its leaves (a 7th-gen list has no ComponentSpacer to replace) and adds
    the shield stats rather than replacing them. Tests/1.6/CompatPatchTests.cs applies the two
    files in both orders and checks the result. A setting change takes effect at the next
    startup, as with every patch PatchOperationSetting gates.
  -->
  <Operation Class="ToxinWarcasket.PatchOperationModActive">
    <packageIds>
      <li>ceteam.combatextended</li>
    </packageIds>
    <match Class="ToxinWarcasket.PatchOperationSetting">
      <setting>spacerTier</setting>

      <!-- 7th generation: the Aerial's numbers. -->
      <nomatch Class="PatchOperationSequence">
        <operations>

          <!-- Armor and shoulders: plating. -->
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/statBases/ArmorRating_Sharp</xpath>
            <value>
              <ArmorRating_Sharp>28</ArmorRating_Sharp>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/statBases/ArmorRating_Blunt</xpath>
            <value>
              <ArmorRating_Blunt>70</ArmorRating_Blunt>
            </value>
          </li>

          <!-- Armor: bulk, carry, costs. -->
          <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/statBases</xpath>
            <value>
              <Bulk>250</Bulk>
              <WornBulk>25</WornBulk>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/equippedStatOffsets</xpath>
            <value>
              <CarryWeight>250</CarryWeight>
              <CarryBulk>200</CarryBulk>
              <Suppressability>-100</Suppressability>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/costList/ComponentIndustrial</xpath>
            <value>
              <ComponentIndustrial>16</ComponentIndustrial>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/costList/Steel</xpath>
            <value>
              <Steel>280</Steel>
            </value>
          </li>

          <!-- Shoulders: bulk, costs. -->
          <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/statBases</xpath>
            <value>
              <Bulk>15</Bulk>
              <WornBulk>5</WornBulk>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/costList/ComponentIndustrial</xpath>
            <value>
              <ComponentIndustrial>4</ComponentIndustrial>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/costList/Steel</xpath>
            <value>
              <Steel>110</Steel>
            </value>
          </li>

          <!-- Helmet: plating, bulk, night vision, smoke, costs. -->
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/statBases/ArmorRating_Sharp</xpath>
            <value>
              <ArmorRating_Sharp>25</ArmorRating_Sharp>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/statBases/ArmorRating_Blunt</xpath>
            <value>
              <ArmorRating_Blunt>56</ArmorRating_Blunt>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/statBases</xpath>
            <value>
              <Bulk>15</Bulk>
              <WornBulk>8</WornBulk>
              <NightVisionEfficiency_Apparel>0.5</NightVisionEfficiency_Apparel>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/equippedStatOffsets</xpath>
            <value>
              <SmokeSensitivity>-1</SmokeSensitivity>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/costList/ComponentIndustrial</xpath>
            <value>
              <ComponentIndustrial>6</ComponentIndustrial>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/costList/Steel</xpath>
            <value>
              <Steel>90</Steel>
            </value>
          </li>

        </operations>
      </nomatch>

      <!-- Spacer tier: the Siegebreaker's numbers. -->
      <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
        <operations>

          <!-- Armor and shoulders: plating. -->
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/statBases/ArmorRating_Sharp</xpath>
            <value>
              <ArmorRating_Sharp>36</ArmorRating_Sharp>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin" or defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/statBases/ArmorRating_Blunt</xpath>
            <value>
              <ArmorRating_Blunt>90</ArmorRating_Blunt>
            </value>
          </li>

          <!-- Armor: bulk, shield, carry, costs. -->
          <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/statBases</xpath>
            <value>
              <Bulk>275</Bulk>
              <WornBulk>35</WornBulk>
              <EnergyShieldRechargeRate>0.015</EnergyShieldRechargeRate>
              <EnergyShieldEnergyMax>2.25</EnergyShieldEnergyMax>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/equippedStatOffsets</xpath>
            <value>
              <CarryWeight>250</CarryWeight>
              <CarryBulk>225</CarryBulk>
              <Suppressability>-100</Suppressability>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_Warcasket_Toxin"]/costList</xpath>
            <value>
              <costList>
                <ComponentSpacer>8</ComponentSpacer>
                <Plasteel>225</Plasteel>
                <Uranium>50</Uranium>
                <Chemfuel>30</Chemfuel>
              </costList>
            </value>
          </li>

          <!-- Shoulders: bulk, costs. -->
          <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/statBases</xpath>
            <value>
              <Bulk>15</Bulk>
              <WornBulk>5</WornBulk>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin"]/costList</xpath>
            <value>
              <costList>
                <ComponentSpacer>2</ComponentSpacer>
                <Plasteel>90</Plasteel>
                <Chemfuel>15</Chemfuel>
              </costList>
            </value>
          </li>

          <!-- Helmet: plating, bulk, night vision, smoke, costs. -->
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/statBases/ArmorRating_Sharp</xpath>
            <value>
              <ArmorRating_Sharp>32</ArmorRating_Sharp>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/statBases/ArmorRating_Blunt</xpath>
            <value>
              <ArmorRating_Blunt>72</ArmorRating_Blunt>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/statBases</xpath>
            <value>
              <Bulk>20</Bulk>
              <WornBulk>10</WornBulk>
              <NightVisionEfficiency_Apparel>0.75</NightVisionEfficiency_Apparel>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/equippedStatOffsets</xpath>
            <value>
              <SmokeSensitivity>-1</SmokeSensitivity>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <xpath>/Defs/VFEPirates.WarcasketDef[defName = "TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin"]/costList</xpath>
            <value>
              <costList>
                <ComponentSpacer>6</ComponentSpacer>
                <Plasteel>90</Plasteel>
                <Chemfuel>10</Chemfuel>
              </costList>
            </value>
          </li>

        </operations>
      </match>
    </match>
  </Operation>
</Patch>
